## Setup

```bash
uv sync
{% if include_react %}(cd frontend && npm install)
{% endif %}```

> Setup is manual — dex runs `uv sync` on scaffold, but re-run it after editing
> dependencies.{% if include_react %} The React frontend needs `npm install` separately.{% endif %}

## Configure

Edit workspace hosts and catalog in `databricks.yml` (targets `dev`, `staging`, `prod`)
before deploying.

## Develop

```bash
dex run test        # uv run pytest
dex run lint        # uv run ruff check .
dex run typecheck   # uv run ty check
dex run validate    # databricks bundle validate
```

## Deploy

```bash
dex run deploy                        # dev (default target)
databricks bundle deploy -t staging
databricks bundle deploy -t prod
```

